# A bestowed Springheart Nantuko on Ornithopter is exiled with it by Tawnos's Coffin; in exile it is an enchantment
# creature card, not an Aura (CR 400.7, 702.103b). When the Coffin untaps, Ornithopter returns tapped, and "return the
# other exiled cards ... attached to that permanent" puts the Nantuko onto the battlefield unattached (CR 303.4h).
[Bot1 Deck]
Tawnos's Coffin
Gleemox
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Springheart Nantuko
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tawnos's Coffin.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
