Bot1.Hand.Springheart Nantuko.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Ability: Bestow)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Springheart Nantuko.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Tawnos's Coffin.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile.Count = 2
Bot1.Accept
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

